            <ArticleTitle>Complete Genome Sequences of Two Vesicular Stomatitis Virus Isolates Collected in Mexico.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01006-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01006-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report two full-genome sequences of vesicular stomatitis New Jersey virus (VSNJV) obtained by Illumina next-generation sequencing of RNA isolated from epithelial suspensions of cattle naturally infected in Mexico. These genomes represent the first full-genome sequences of vesicular stomatitis New Jersey viruses circulating in Mexico deposited in the GenBank database.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
